      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Scott, \n\ngclient.py allow users to specify the lock_timeout via command line, but it seems no matter what the users have set, `gclient sync` will hit this timeout first, if there are multiple git processes. So I am thinking if we could allow the contains_revision to respect the lock_timeout? Thoughts?",
