      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Note the default lock_timeout is 5000 sec\n\ncan you share the link to the config? Is it the default time out for the entire gclient sync run? Note that this lock is only for a single git-command, and it doesn\u0027t even have to be run in every so often repeatedly. If it gets called every so often for certain repos, it\u0027s better to fix it instead.\n\nI\u0027m still not sure if increasing the timeout for this single git-command for checking the existing of git-cache for a given repo should be set like 5000s. It doesn\u0027t sound right to me. If it fixes the timeout issue, it may be that it just hide other problems.",
