      "message": "Do you mean this line? https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/tools/depot_tools/+/main:gclient.py;drc\u003d45ca62ae3aab01c35e7c2f868f449f213d30d68a;l\u003d3964\n\nPer doc string, I don\u0027t think it is for the entire gclient sync.\n\n\u003e single git-command for checking the existing of git-cache for a given repo should be set like 5000s\n\nI don\u0027t think 5000s are necessary neither. Is the lock only for `git cat-file`? Any cases that the git command could take longer? So far I got below error.\n\nIt always happens at the beginning of the build, when we load the cache(possible that multiple processes try to write).\n\n```\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/metrics.py\", line 302, in print_notice_and_exit\n    yield\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient.py\", line 4680, in \u003cmodule\u003e\n    sys.exit(main(sys.argv[1:]))\n             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient.py\", line 4666, in main\n    return dispatcher.execute(OptionParser(), argv)\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/subcommand.py\", line 262, in execute\n    return command(parser, args[1:])\n           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient.py\", line 4019, in CMDsync\n    ret \u003d client.RunOnDeps(\u0027update\u0027, args)\n          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient.py\", line 2450, in RunOnDeps\n    work_queue.flush(revision_overrides,\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient_utils.py\", line 1045, in flush\n    reraise(e[0], e[1], e[2])\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient_utils.py\", line 54, in reraise\n    raise value\n  File \"/__w/cobalt_sandbox/cobalt_sandbox/depot_tools/gclient_utils.p